      "name": { "en": "Party in Perfect Paradise", "zh-CN": "极乐派对" },
      "description": {
        "en": "When SPD is #1[i] or higher, increases this unit's Elation by #2[i]%. For every #3[i] SPD exceeding that threshold, additionally increases this unit's Elation by #4[i]%. Up to a max of #5[i] excess SPD can be taken into account for this effect.",
        "zh-CN": "速度大于等于#1[i]时，使自身欢愉度提高#2[i]%，之后每超过#3[i]点速度使自身欢愉度额外提高#4[i]%，最多计入#5[i]点超出的速度。"
